   Copyright (c) 2021 risinek
   License: See original repository

2. ESP8266 Deauther by spacehuhn (inspiration)
   Repository: https://github.com/SpacehuhnTech/esp8266_deauther
   Copyright (c) spacehuhn
   License: See original repository

