   Repository: https://github.com/ckcr4lyf/EvilAppleJuice-ESP32
   Contributors: justcallmekoko, ckcr4lyf
   License: See original repository

4. u8g2 Graphics Library
   Repository: https://github.com/olikraus/u8g2
   Copyright (c) olikraus
   License: BSD 2-Clause License

5. esp-nimble-cpp
   Repository: https://github.com/h2zero/esp-nimble-cpp
   License: Apache License 2.0

